#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0649 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "STAGE-G AUTHORING CORRECTION: the instruction list's column spec ('ONTRTFL(Char), ONTRTFL(Char)') duplicates the same column name, which a .cdt table cannot represent; the near-miss shape is completed by analogy with the sibling PMDA-AD0647/AD0648 near-miss fixtures (a mistyped-index period column alongside the real overall flag). ONTR1FL is a ONE-digit index, where ^ONTR\\d{2}FL\$ demands exactly two, so varname() is false for every column and nothing fires despite the firing value pattern. This is the fixture that keeps the four flag rules apart."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col ASEQ     type=Num
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col ONTR1FL  type=Char
col ONTRTFL  type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | HEADACHE | Y | N
